          <a href="#building-a-week" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Putting Them Into a Week</a>
          <a href="#progression" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. A Six-Week Progression</a>
          <a href="#form-and-safety" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">12. Form, Warm-Ups and Treadmill Safety</a>
          <a href="#walking-pads" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">13. If Your Treadmill Has No Incline</a>
          <a href="#verdict" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">14. The Verdict</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">15. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
        </nav>
